A `--stub-macro` argument with no `=` is rejected on its own message, distinct from the `--set` one,
and nothing renders.

-- fixtures/cwd/probe.md.j2 --
threshold {{ config.core.sprint.default_threshold_sp }}
-- cmd --
booping render /proc/self/cwd/probe.md.j2 --stub-macro nope
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: malformed --stub-macro pair (expected DOTTED.PATH=LITERAL): nope
